#. const CARD_RISE_TEXT := "The Throne stone cracks. Amber light pours up through the isle, the pillars fall into
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:140
msgid "The Throne stone cracks. Amber light pours up through the isle, the pillars fall into the moat, and a giant of rubble and old stone climbs out of the Hollow, a burning heart in its chest. Four pillars rise around the water, each feeding it a golden thread."
msgstr ""

#. const CARD_STORM_TEXT := "The Colossus raises its fist over Vessa. Thunder answers. A bolt splits the sky, the
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:141
msgid "The Colossus raises its fist over Vessa. Thunder answers. A bolt splits the sky, the giant staggers to its knees, and out of the storm walks an old man with a sword that hums like a struck bell. Old Vey is alive."
msgstr ""

#. const CARD_ENDING_TEXT := "Fire and lightning shatter the heart. Obren's body falls. In the grey dawn Malrik p
#: scripts/campaign/mission_04.gd:142
msgid "Fire and lightning shatter the heart. Obren's body falls. In the grey dawn Malrik picks up the still-pulsing heart-stone and melts into the mist with it while the Shadow army withdraws. Vey tells Vessa the Master is alive below, and the three relics turn white-gold and point down."
msgstr ""

