msgstr ""

#. "A hundred winters ago. The Master has just sealed something under Crown Hollow, and the four kingdoms are new
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e6_01.gd:127
msgid "A hundred winters ago. The Master has just sealed something under Crown Hollow, and the four kingdoms are new. The north belongs to his eldest apprentice, Torvald, who has a keep, a lake, and no great love of visitors."
msgstr ""

#. "Tonight the Master walks out onto the lake with a block of blue ice in his arms. Something inside it shines. 
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e6_01.gd:128
msgid "Tonight the Master walks out onto the lake with a block of blue ice in his arms. Something inside it shines. He asks Torvald to keep it cold until he comes back for it, and warns him that something will come for it every winter."
msgstr ""

#. "A fisher girl from the Stillwater huts has followed him onto the ice and will not go home. Her name is Aldra.
#: scripts/campaign/mission_e6_01.gd:129
msgid "A fisher girl from the Stillwater huts has followed him onto the ice and will not go home. Her name is Aldra. Three winters are coming. Keep the Heartfrost."
msgstr ""

#. const HINT_START := "Keep the Heartfrost alive through three winters. Wardens come from the cracks in the nort
